I stand corrected, Anthropic API does not like multiple `user` role messages in a row (other APIs are more liberal).

```json
{
  "type": "error",
  "error": {
    "type": "invalid_request_error",
    "message": "messages: roles must alternate between \"user\" and \"assistant\", but found multiple \"user\" roles in a row"
  }
}
```

A solution would be to merge additional user input with the last `user` role message in the array (if not identical content), in case there is no `assistant` message as last item in the array.

